18	/**
19	 * @file cholesky.hpp
20	 * @brief This file contains cholesky functions
21	 *   - cholesky                 : Entry point function
22	 *   - choleskyTop             : Top level function that selects implementation architecture and internal types based
23	 * on a traits class.
24	 *   - choleskyBasic           : Basic implementation requiring lower resource
25	 *   - choleskyAlt             : Lower latency architecture requiring more resources
26	 *   - choleskyAlt2            : Further improved latency architecture requiring higher resource
27	 */
